# Build output — the critical one
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Source control and IDE
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.DotSettings.user

# Docs — changes constantly, would bust the build cache
docs/
**/*.md
**/*.http

# Dev-only config
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

# Secrets
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/.env
**/*.pfx
**/*.key

# Docker's own files
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# OS noise
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini